# TarnakCode: Others/ is mostly build/runtime outputs (dist, packed, etc.)
# but Others/build/ contains design-time scripts (notarize.js, installer.nsh,
# entitlements.mac.plist) REQUIRED by electron-builder. Track those; ignore
# the rest of Others/.
Others/*
Others/*/
!Others/build/
!Others/build/*

